    <item>
      <title>Check shifts</title>
      <link>https://sanskrit.github.io/groups/dyuganga/internal/clocking/check-shifts/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://sanskrit.github.io/groups/dyuganga/internal/clocking/check-shifts/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div id=&#34;checkShiftsApp&#34; class=&#34;check-shifts-app&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;cs-brand&#34;&gt;Dyuganga&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;cs-subtitle&#34;&gt;Review your shifts from the last 32 days and request a correction.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;cs-topline&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span id=&#34;csStatus&#34; class=&#34;cs-status-pill&#34;&gt;Sign in to continue&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;../clock/&#34;&gt;Back to Shift Clock&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &lt;section id=&#34;csLoginCard&#34; class=&#34;cs-card&#34; hidden&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;cs-title&#34;&gt;Sign in&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;cs-hint&#34;&gt;Use your Personnel name and the value in the &lt;code&gt;pw&lt;/code&gt; column.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;cs-row&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;select id=&#34;csLoginUser&#34; aria-label=&#34;User&#34;&gt;&lt;/select&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input id=&#34;csLoginPassword&#34; type=&#34;password&#34; autocomplete=&#34;current-password&#34; placeholder=&#34;Password&#34; aria-label=&#34;Password&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button id=&#34;csSignInBtn&#34; class=&#34;cs-btn cs-btn-primary&#34; type=&#34;button&#34;&gt;Sign in&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p id=&#34;csLoginMsg&#34; class=&#34;cs-hint&#34; role=&#34;status&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/section&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &lt;section id=&#34;csShiftsCard&#34; class=&#34;cs-card&#34; hidden&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;cs-row cs-row-between&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;cs-title&#34;&gt;Your shifts, last 32 days&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p id=&#34;csViewerMsg&#34; class=&#34;cs-hint&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;cs-row cs-row-actions&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;button id=&#34;csRefreshBtn&#34; class=&#34;cs-btn cs-btn-secondary cs-btn-small&#34; type=&#34;button&#34;&gt;Refresh&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;        &lt;button id=&#34;csSignOutBtn&#34; class=&#34;cs-btn cs-btn-secondary cs-btn-small&#34; type=&#34;button&#34;&gt;Sign out&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p id=&#34;csShiftsMsg&#34; class=&#34;cs-hint&#34; role=&#34;status&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;cs-table-wrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;table class=&#34;cs-table&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;thead&gt;&#xA;          &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;            &lt;th&gt;User&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;            &lt;th&gt;Start&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;            &lt;th&gt;End&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;            &lt;th&gt;Hours&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;            &lt;th&gt;Notes&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;            &lt;th&gt;Pending&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;            &lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/thead&gt;&#xA;        &lt;tbody id=&#34;csShiftsBody&#34;&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/table&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;cs-hint&#34;&gt;Requesting deletion sets that row&#39;s &lt;code&gt;Pending&lt;/code&gt; column to &lt;code&gt;Delete&lt;/code&gt;. The manager reviews pending requests in the sheet.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/section&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &lt;section id=&#34;csAddCard&#34; class=&#34;cs-card&#34; hidden&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;cs-title&#34;&gt;Request an addition&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;cs-hint&#34;&gt;Use full start and end date-times. For a shift crossing midnight, choose the next day for End. The new row will be marked &lt;code&gt;Pending = Add&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Clock setup</title>
      <link>https://sanskrit.github.io/groups/dyuganga/internal/clocking/clock-setup/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://sanskrit.github.io/groups/dyuganga/internal/clocking/clock-setup/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The browser clock is at &lt;a href=&#34;../clock/&#34;&gt;Shift Clock&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;users-and-passwords&#34;&gt;Users and passwords&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Users are read from the &lt;strong&gt;Personnel&lt;/strong&gt; sheet of the private Dyuganga spreadsheet.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Only rows with a non-empty &lt;code&gt;pw&lt;/code&gt; cell are listed in the dropdown.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;code&gt;Name&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;pw&lt;/code&gt; columns are found by header name.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The value of the &lt;code&gt;pw&lt;/code&gt; cell is the password.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Clear a &lt;code&gt;pw&lt;/code&gt; cell to disable that user.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The browser stores a signed session token for 180 days. It does not store the password.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Passwords are managed by editing the &lt;code&gt;pw&lt;/code&gt; column, or by running &lt;code&gt;createUserFromPrompt()&lt;/code&gt; in the Apps Script editor.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Shift Clock</title>
      <link>https://sanskrit.github.io/groups/dyuganga/internal/clocking/clock/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://sanskrit.github.io/groups/dyuganga/internal/clocking/clock/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div id=&#34;shiftClockApp&#34; class=&#34;shift-clock-app&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;sc-brand&#34;&gt;Dyuganga&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;sc-subtitle&#34;&gt;Start a shift, end it, and record the hours in the private spreadsheet.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;sc-topline&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span id=&#34;connStatus&#34; class=&#34;sc-status-pill&#34;&gt;Spreadsheet setup needed&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sc-private-note&#34;&gt;Private sheet &amp;middot; Personnel-managed users&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;../check-shifts/&#34;&gt;Check shifts&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;../clock-setup/&#34;&gt;Setup&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &lt;section class=&#34;sc-card&#34; aria-labelledby=&#34;controlsTitle&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span id=&#34;controlsTitle&#34; class=&#34;sc-sr-only&#34;&gt;Shift controls&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label class=&#34;sc-field&#34; for=&#34;userSelect&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;span class=&#34;sc-field-label&#34;&gt;User&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;select id=&#34;userSelect&#34; autocomplete=&#34;off&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;option value=&#34;&#34;&gt;Select user...&lt;/option&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/select&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p id=&#34;userHint&#34; class=&#34;sc-hint&#34;&gt;Choose a user to enable the buttons.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;sc-clock-display&#34; id=&#34;liveClock&#34;&gt;--:--:--&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;sc-clock-date&#34; id=&#34;liveDate&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;sc-actions&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button id=&#34;startBtn&#34; class=&#34;sc-btn sc-btn-primary&#34; type=&#34;button&#34; disabled&gt;Start shift&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button id=&#34;endBtn&#34; class=&#34;sc-btn sc-btn-danger&#34; type=&#34;button&#34; disabled&gt;End shift&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;startNotice&#34; class=&#34;sc-start-notice&#34; hidden&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;activePanel&#34; class=&#34;sc-active-panel&#34; hidden&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;sc-active-grid&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div&gt;&#xA;          &lt;span class=&#34;sc-label&#34;&gt;User&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;          &lt;span class=&#34;sc-value&#34; id=&#34;activeUser&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div&gt;&#xA;          &lt;span class=&#34;sc-label&#34;&gt;Started&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;          &lt;span class=&#34;sc-value&#34; id=&#34;activeStart&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;sc-elapsed&#34;&gt;Elapsed: &lt;span id=&#34;elapsed&#34;&gt;0m 00s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div id=&#34;over2h&#34; class=&#34;sc-warn-banner&#34; hidden&gt;Warning: this shift has exceeded 2 hours.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/section&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &lt;section id=&#34;authPanel&#34; class=&#34;sc-card&#34; hidden aria-live=&#34;polite&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;authTitle&#34; class=&#34;sc-result-title&#34; role=&#34;heading&#34; aria-level=&#34;2&#34;&gt;Sign in&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p id=&#34;authMsg&#34; class=&#34;sc-hint&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;sc-row&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input id=&#34;passwordInput&#34; type=&#34;password&#34; autocomplete=&#34;current-password&#34; placeholder=&#34;Password&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button id=&#34;signInBtn&#34; class=&#34;sc-btn sc-btn-primary sc-btn-small&#34; type=&#34;button&#34;&gt;Sign in&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button id=&#34;cancelAuthBtn&#34; class=&#34;sc-btn sc-btn-secondary sc-btn-small&#34; type=&#34;button&#34;&gt;Cancel&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/section&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &lt;section id=&#34;result&#34; class=&#34;sc-card sc-result-card&#34; aria-live=&#34;polite&#34; hidden&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;resultTitle&#34; class=&#34;sc-result-title&#34; role=&#34;heading&#34; aria-level=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p id=&#34;resultMsg&#34; class=&#34;sc-result-msg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p id=&#34;resultWarn&#34; class=&#34;sc-warn-banner&#34; hidden&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;pre id=&#34;dataBlock&#34; class=&#34;sc-data-block&#34; aria-label=&#34;Shift data for the spreadsheet&#34;&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;sc-actions&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button id=&#34;copyRowBtn&#34; class=&#34;sc-btn sc-btn-secondary sc-btn-small&#34; type=&#34;button&#34;&gt;Copy rows (TSV)&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button id=&#34;copyHeaderBtn&#34; class=&#34;sc-btn sc-btn-secondary sc-btn-small&#34; type=&#34;button&#34;&gt;Copy rows + header&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button id=&#34;copyEmailBtn&#34; class=&#34;sc-btn sc-btn-secondary sc-btn-small&#34; type=&#34;button&#34;&gt;Copy for email&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a id=&#34;editShiftLink&#34; class=&#34;sc-btn sc-btn-secondary sc-btn-small&#34; href=&#34;../check-shifts/&#34; hidden&gt;Open Check shifts&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button id=&#34;retryBtn&#34; class=&#34;sc-btn sc-btn-primary sc-btn-small&#34; type=&#34;button&#34; hidden&gt;Retry upload&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;      &lt;button id=&#34;dismissBtn&#34; class=&#34;sc-btn sc-btn-secondary sc-btn-small&#34; type=&#34;button&#34; hidden&gt;I have sent them - dismiss&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;sc-hint&#34;&gt;If the spreadsheet cannot be reached, copy the rows and send them to your manager by email (or paste them into the spreadsheet yourself).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
